      "basis_note": "The crop database column is PH_2:1, a water suspension, so the curve is defined on pH in water. A reading in 0.01 mol/L CaCl2 sits about 0.6 units below it and one in 1 mol/L KCl about 1.0 unit below, both with real scatter between soils. These offsets are averages for tropical soils and are applied only when the user declares the basis; they are recorded with every result that used them."
